eal estate market. Nestled within the exclusive Keturah Resort in Al Jaddaf, this off-plan community presents a curated selection of eight G+7 residential buildings and twelve G+2+B waterfront mansions. Branded by Ritz-Carlton, the residences offer 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, spacious 3-bedroom penthouses, and opulent 8-bedroom mansions—each fully furnished with internationally renowned designer pieces and high-end brands.This exceptional waterfront development redefines luxury living with its exclusive amenities, including a wellness hotel, a private marina designed for yachts, and eight boutique retail spaces. Residents will enjoy access to a shared pool, children’s pool, private beach, and leisure areas designed for ultimate relaxation. Additional features such as a cinema, coworking zone, dining outlets, and a state-of-the-art gym create a seamless blend of comfort, wellness, and convenience, all set against the serene backdrop of Dubai Creekside.","price":11000000,"title":"The Ritz Carlton Residences","bitrix":{"id":80,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Ritz Carlton Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Ritz Carlton Residences","property_type":"Mansion","developer_name":"The Ritz-Carlton","project_location":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/ritz_feature_0d78f09bf2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/ritz_feature_0d78f09bf2.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2426137,"lng":55.3408692},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/ritz1_340598222f.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/ritz1_340598222f.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/ritz_3_1024x523_32aed71888.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/ritz_3_1024x523_32aed71888.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/ritz_5_58ff7ac12